data.reasoning_content:
The server already serves /map-assets/ and there's a ready-made style.json using pmtiles:///map-assets/bangalore.pmtiles. In the frontend, I need to register the pmtiles protocol and load style "/map-assets/style.json". maplibre with pmtiles Protocol: 

```ts
import { Protocol } from "pmtiles";
import maplibregl from "maplibre-gl";
const protocol = new Protocol();
maplibregl.addProtocol("pmtiles", protocol.tile);
```

Then map style: fetch "/map-assets/style.json" — pmtiles:// URL relative path... The PMTiles protocol resolves "pmtiles:///map-assets/bangalore.pmtiles" — the URL after protocol is "/map-assets/bangalore.pmtiles"; pmtiles JS treats it as URL — FetchSource with that path relative to origin should work.

FileServer supports Range requests, good.

Map data overlay: operations state is dispatcher/admin only. For other roles, map shows just basemap + maybe serviceability regions? read-serviceability-snapshot — checkits permission.

